WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.385
Júlia: Hi everyone!

2
00:00:01.685 --> 00:00:04.879
I’m Júlia and this is my vlog about swimming.

3
00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.465
Júlia: Today I’m at the pool.

4
00:00:07.765 --> 00:00:10.194
It’s raining outside, but it’s warm here.

5
00:00:10.494 --> 00:00:13.220
I’m wearing my swimsuit, a cap and goggles.

6
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:15.820
My friend Aina is swimming in lane three.

7
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.521
Júlia: I usually swim on Mondays and Thursdays with my club.

8
00:00:20.821 --> 00:00:23.709
But today is different: we have a competition!

9
00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:27.293
Júlia: In this photo, we’re at a competition.

10
00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:29.233
Aina is swimming and we’re cheering.

11
00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.632
Júlia: I love swimming because it’s relaxing.

12
00:00:32.931 --> 00:00:34.422
I like being with my friends.

13
00:00:34.722 --> 00:00:36.118
I don’t like cold water!

14
00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:38.487
Júlia: Two screen tips.

15
00:00:38.787 --> 00:00:41.230
Take a break after thirty minutes on a screen.

16
00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:44.292
Don’t use your phone in bed: put it in the kitchen.

17
00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:47.341
Júlia: Photos: me and my club.

18
00:00:47.641 --> 00:00:52.168
Facts: “Swimming”, Encyclopedia website, 2026.

19
00:00:52.468 --> 00:00:53.659
Thanks for watching!

20
00:00:53.959 --> 00:00:55.009
See you next time!
